WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:20.882
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:20.883 --> 00:00:25.162
I'm an African lion.

3
00:00:25.163 --> 00:00:29.851
We are very big cats.

4
00:00:29.852 --> 00:00:35.267
African lions live in Africa, right?

5
00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:37.202
Right!

6
00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:42.152
We live near grasslands and woodlands.

7
00:00:42.153 --> 00:00:45.668
Do you live alone?

8
00:00:45.669 --> 00:00:49.958
Other big cats live alone.

9
00:00:49.959 --> 00:00:54.992
But lions live in groups called prides.

10
00:00:54.993 --> 00:01:02.272
A pride usually has about 15 lions.

11
00:01:02.273 --> 00:01:05.290
I like your mane.

12
00:01:05.291 --> 00:01:10.249
Only male lions have manes.

13
00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:15.659
The manes make us look bigger.

14
00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:25.761
That helps us to protect our pride.

15
00:01:25.762 --> 00:01:29.703
You roar loudly!

16
00:01:29.704 --> 00:01:34.767
Male lions roar more than females.

17
00:01:34.768 --> 00:01:38.838
We roar to call our prides.

18
00:01:38.839 --> 00:01:43.655
We also scare other animals away.

19
00:01:43.656 --> 00:01:46.293
What do you eat?

20
00:01:46.294 --> 00:01:52.602
We mostly eat wildebeests, zebras, and antelopes.

21
00:01:52.603 --> 00:01:57.953
Sometimes we eat small rodents too.

22
00:01:57.954 --> 00:02:00.910
Do you go hunting?

23
00:02:00.911 --> 00:02:06.784
No. Female lions hunt for the whole pride.

24
00:02:06.785 --> 00:02:15.674
They go together at night.

25
00:02:15.675 --> 00:02:20.353
I see another lion coming.

26
00:02:20.354 --> 00:02:25.506
I must protect our territory!

27
00:02:25.507 --> 00:02:32.812
Good-bye, African Lion!
